    d['what_to_do_next'] = 'FAILED: the promise was NOT recorded. Never say it is recorded. If this is the first failed create_promise in this call: tell the customer there was a technical problem and you will try again, and call create_promise again right now with exactly the same amount and date. If create_promise already failed once before in this call: tell the customer you could not record the promise, thank them, say goodbye and call close_call with outcome no_promise and reason service_error.'
''')

